<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; max-width: 640px;">
    <p>Dear team,</p>

    <p>
        Please use the attached documents to prepare the following Bank Guarantee.<br>
        The purpose of the Bank Guarantee is {{data.bgPurpose}}.
    </p>

    <p>
        Please prepare the BG using the details below:<br>
        {{#if data.referenceValue}}{{data.referenceLabel}}: {{data.referenceValue}}<br>{{/if}}
        BG in favor of: {{data.beneficiaryName}}<br>
        BG Expiry Date: {{data.bgExpiryDate}}<br>
        BG Claim Date: {{data.claimDate}}<br>
        Amount: Rs. {{data.amount}}<br>
        {{#if data.stampPaperValue}}BG Stamp paper value: Rs. {{data.stampPaperValue}}<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.fdrMargin}}FDR %age for Margin: {{data.fdrMargin}}<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.hasBgFormat}}BG Formats: attached.<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.hasSupportingDoc}}{{data.supportingDocName}}: attached with the mail.<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.hasCeoRequestLetter}}Request Letter, Signed by CEO: attached with the mail.{{/if}}
    </p>

    {{#if data.hasBeneficiaryAccount}}
    <p>
        Beneficiary Account details:<br>
        {{#if data.beneName}}Beneficiary Name: {{data.beneName}}<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.beneAcc}}Account No.: {{data.beneAcc}}<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.beneIfsc}}IFSC code: {{data.beneIfsc}}<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.uniqueCode}}Unique Code: {{data.uniqueCode}}{{/if}}
    </p>
    {{/if}}

    <p>
        Please make a close ended BG. BG Format text vetting is not accepted as the text as it has been provided by a
        Government Organization, which does not allow any changes to the BG Format.
    </p>

    <p>
        Also, please debit our account no. {{data.debitAccountNo}}, for the amount for BG commission and SFMS Charges.
    </p>

    <p>
        Please prepare the BG within the timeline mentioned above and share the SOFT COPY of the BG along with SFMS
        confirmation by replying to this mail.
    </p>

    <p style="font-style: italic;">"Ensuring timely operations is the only source of growth."</p>

    <p>
        Regards,<br>
        Imran Khan,<br>
        Accounts Leader,<br>
        +91-88825-91733
    </p>

    <p>
        Approved by Piyush Goyal<br>
        +91-96503-93636<br>
        CEO,<br>
        Volks Energie Pvt. Ltd.
    </p>
</div>
